  "body": "Geolocation currently uses the \"page visibility change steps\" to wait for a document to become visible before position changes are sent to a page (amongst other things).  \r\n\r\nThe HTML spec's \"page visibility change steps\" suggest that integration of these steps should happen in HTML itself. \r\n\r\nCC @noamr... let's draft something up. ",
